{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Twin elements. Infinite momentum. Danger from every direction.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Merge spells, cross dimensions, and dance through deadly arenas in this lightning-fast shooter. Alone or together - Claim your immortality on cross-platform leaderboards. Your name is eternal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/extras/b394f50bce4d03b578b8711281a0db69.avif?t=1761118608\" width=1232 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enemies strike from all sides - survive by mastering your movement and aggression.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/extras/88fc816234908ac88c93937e9fdcc185.poster.avif?t=1761118608\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/extras/88fc816234908ac88c93937e9fdcc185.webm?t=1761118608\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/extras/88fc816234908ac88c93937e9fdcc185.mp4?t=1761118608\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700810/extras/77b7060e2d869563a5c7a47b6f9b3a62.avif?t=1761118608\" width=1232 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Assign elemental runes to each hand and fuse them for devastating results.</p><p class=\"bb_para